WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:36.225
Lutwik will be gone in 8 days.
Emporium in 10.

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:39.232
And if it continues to expand
even after that, in time...

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.826
Why has such a thing surfaced now?

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:45.937
Rather, do we have proof that
this is Gravestone to begin with?

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:50.143
There is no record that Gravestone
was completely destroyed.

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:51.778
When the air strike took place,

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.980
if we assume that it activated
the space distortion device...

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.039
...and took refuge in an alternate dimension...

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:57.613
Even if it did, why?

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.086
Right now, resolving this
situation takes precedence...

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.519
...over finding out why.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:05.992
The distorted space is growing,
even as we speak.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:08.094
Moreover, we do not know if
our technology is capable...

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.824
...of dealing with such tremendous energy.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:14.100
At this rate, this relic of the Great War...

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.727
...will swallow up the world.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:33.217
Paife

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.100
Teacher!

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:50.870
Are you going somewhere?

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.768
Work.

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:52.672
What about school?

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.506
I'm taking time off.

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.408
What? Where are you going?

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:56.209
The desert.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.268
The desert? Then that's the same as Hono!

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:02.842
Oh, Hono is someone who's
like a big sister to me.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:12.287
The combustion efficiency
is dramatically better.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:16.087
And it looks like they made a lot
of other modifications, too.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.019
Talk about excellent service!

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:20.925
It just goes to show how dangerous this job is.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:22.225
Right you are.

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.103
To think they asked you...

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:26.333
...to pinpoint the cause of
the sand dragon stampede...

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:31.469
That is the job I have for you.

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:34.403
Won't you please accept it, Honoka?

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:37.584
I'm happy that you have such confidence in me,

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.484
but my tank is in for repairs right now.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:44.686
Besides, isn't some kind of special
knowledge required for a job like that?

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:46.426
I realize that.

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:49.554
That is why what I want you
to do is to collect data.

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:50.688
Data?

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:54.400
I would love to dispatch an
investigative team to the location,

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.869
but with a large-scale investigation of that sort,

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:59.667
the Inspection Force requires a
procedure that is quite cumbersome.

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:02.032
I don't want to waste any time.

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:03.805
Isn't the Inspection Force...

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.378
Aren't The Third investigating this matter?

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:09.937
I wondered the same and I did contact them.

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.348
However,

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.720
to be honest,

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.712
they have been behaving
strangely these past few days.

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.914
They haven't conducted a single
compulsory investigation.

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.350
It seems they have completely
halted their operations.

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:23.358
What does that mean?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:24.922
I do not know.

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:28.231
Perhaps something has
occurred in Hyperius as well.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.572
We will take on the responsibility
of repairing your tank...

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:35.063
...and making any other
modifications you deem necessary.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.706
Please do this, Honoka.

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:40.708
I have one condition.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:47.918
Awesome! It's awesome, Miss!

00:04:47.987 --> 00:04:49.181
Can you believe it?!

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:52.425
All of those people are Technos
with skills as good as Pops!

00:04:52.425 --> 00:04:54.620
There's really nothing for me to do!

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:58.063
Well, sure, I was pissed off at first.

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:01.529
It didn't feel good to get my work
yanked out from under me.

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:02.926
But see...

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:05.171
I've decided...

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:08.937
...to go to the Administration
Bureau's Technology School.

00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:10.733
What? Really?

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:13.372
Their chief invited me!

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:14.747
He said I had a knack for this...

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:17.483
...and asked if I'd consider getting
a serious foundation in theory!

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:19.849
Of course, I'm not going to quit my current job.

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:23.183
I'll work and study on the side,
and get better at what I do!

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:24.823
And then, someday...

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:26.583
Joey...

00:05:28.695 --> 00:05:29.753
So...

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:33.431
You better make sure you come back.

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:39.702
To let Joey join the Administration
Bureau's tech team.

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:42.506
That was Honoka's condition.

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:45.643
What's wrong?

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.044
It's nothing.

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:50.845
Are you really all right?

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:51.778
What do you mean?

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:54.784
You had a nightmare last night, too.

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:58.691
I don't know about the time
you were apart from me,

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:01.421
but if this had also been
continuing during that time...

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:03.127
I told you! That's...

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:08.657
Motion signature, approaching from the rear.

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:11.070
Based on the size of the heat
source and its velocity,

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:12.469
it's a small vehicle.

00:06:12.972 --> 00:06:13.700
A buggy?

00:06:33.259 --> 00:06:34.123
Hello.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:35.561
We met the other day...

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:37.426
I'm so happy you remember me.

00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:39.160
Hono.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.500
I haven't introduced myself yet, have I?

00:06:42.635 --> 00:06:43.966
I'm Paife.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.805
Is this your tank?

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:47.466
Y-Yes... uh...

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:50.877
Hmm, it's pretty nice.

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:51.138
Um...

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:55.005
Oh, you have a PSP!

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:56.449
Excuse me!

00:06:56.449 --> 00:06:58.383
This thing's been custom tuned, hasn't it?

00:06:58.451 --> 00:06:59.816
What's going on here?

00:07:00.052 --> 00:07:00.720
Hell if I know!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.187
Aww...
Hell if I know!

00:07:01.187 --> 00:07:02.051
Aww...

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:05.054
But you have a Dragon Buster, huh?

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:06.690
What about it?

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:09.662
The maintenance is a pain, it's temperamental...

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:12.131
Well, that's fine, since it's not
like I'm going to be using it.

00:07:12.131 --> 00:07:12.790
Hey!

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.133
What do you think you're doing?

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:16.758
Huh? What do you mean?

00:07:17.637 --> 00:07:20.265
It's only natural that I should
get to know my travel partner.

00:07:20.706 --> 00:07:21.832
Partner?!

00:07:24.477 --> 00:07:25.239
A commission?

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:29.208
Yup. From the Chief Administrator of the
Emporium Administration Bureau.

00:07:29.515 --> 00:07:31.779
She told me to work with you.

00:07:31.851 --> 00:07:32.442
Bogie?

00:07:33.019 --> 00:07:35.180
I've verified it. It appears to be authentic.

00:07:35.655 --> 00:07:39.158
Oh, please! Big sis wouldn't lie to you!

00:07:39.158 --> 00:07:41.058
I look forward to working with you, Hono.

00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:51.861
You're okay with this?

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:56.274
She shouldn't be a hindrance.

00:08:01.447 --> 00:08:03.677
Now, where should we go?

00:08:05.017 --> 00:08:06.109
Hey!

00:08:07.687 --> 00:08:10.986
You're eating breakfast already? That's cold.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:15.024
We're on this journey just the two
of us, so let's at least eat together.

00:08:15.528 --> 00:08:18.631
Oh, I'm sorry. You were sleeping so soundly...

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:19.365
I'll be right down.

00:08:19.365 --> 00:08:21.799
That's okay. I'm going to take a shower first.

00:08:22.201 --> 00:08:22.758
What?

00:08:23.135 --> 00:08:24.033
Paife?!

00:08:31.611 --> 00:08:32.873
That felt good.

00:08:32.945 --> 00:08:34.708
P-P-P-P-P-P-P-Paife?!

00:08:35.615 --> 00:08:36.946
What's wrong, Hono?

00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:39.075
Y-You have to ask?

00:08:39.185 --> 00:08:39.742
Huh?

00:08:40.419 --> 00:08:43.445
Who cares? We're both girls here.

00:08:43.589 --> 00:08:45.819
T-That's true, but...

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:49.583
If you want, you could take your clothes off, too.

00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:51.694
It'll feel cool and refreshing.

00:08:55.268 --> 00:08:56.166
She's so cute.

00:09:00.306 --> 00:09:01.568
Oh, man!

00:09:03.743 --> 00:09:06.041
Sheesh! Where did it go?!

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:07.807
Here it is!

00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:13.378
You okay?

00:09:13.653 --> 00:09:15.211
This is kind of exhausting.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.959
The odd sensation on her forehead
was growing by the day.

00:09:25.031 --> 00:09:29.297
Could it be somehow related to her nightmares?

00:09:30.303 --> 00:09:34.672
Even Honoka did not know
what was happening to her.

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:38.268
I wonder if Iks would know...

00:09:38.344 --> 00:09:39.936
What are you doing, Hono?

00:09:41.113 --> 00:09:44.082
You should organize your things.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:45.014
That's okay.

00:09:45.351 --> 00:09:46.181
So?

00:09:46.352 --> 00:09:48.718
I'm looking for traces of the sand dragons.

00:09:49.188 --> 00:09:50.856
Bogie says...

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:53.518
...the sand becomes magnetized
after sand dragons pass through.

00:09:55.194 --> 00:09:56.262
Say, Hono...

00:09:56.262 --> 00:09:59.966
Um, about calling me that... It's a little...

00:09:59.966 --> 00:10:03.299
Huh? Why? Millie calls you that, too.

00:10:03.369 --> 00:10:05.064
What? Millie?

00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:09.440
Normally, I work as a school nurse.

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:12.539
So, I've heard a lot about you from Millie.

00:10:12.912 --> 00:10:13.708
What?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.816
She's actually the teacher in the nurse's room.

00:10:16.816 --> 00:10:19.216
She's different, but she's a nice person.

00:10:19.719 --> 00:10:22.552
I think maybe she's a little like you.

00:10:23.055 --> 00:10:23.749
What?!

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.617
Well, I guess that was to be expected.

00:10:25.992 --> 00:10:26.890
Oh, um...

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:31.161
Um, then, could I call you Teacher from now on?

00:10:31.664 --> 00:10:32.426
Why?

00:10:32.598 --> 00:10:36.261
There's no real reason,
but you are a Teacher, right?

00:10:36.469 --> 00:10:37.837
Sure, but...

00:10:37.837 --> 00:10:38.861
Then...

00:10:39.138 --> 00:10:41.007
Well, I don't really mind.

00:10:41.007 --> 00:10:43.066
Then, that's settled.

00:10:43.576 --> 00:10:45.373
Shall we get going soon, Teacher?

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:52.609
There appear to be no other options,
except this plan.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.825
Our technology was developed...

00:10:59.825 --> 00:11:03.352
...based on old-world knowledge
from before the Great War.

00:11:03.929 --> 00:11:05.931
With that technology proving useless,

00:11:05.931 --> 00:11:08.167
we are about to use a relic of the Great War...

00:11:08.167 --> 00:11:11.193
...in order to destroy another
relic of the Great War.

00:11:11.737 --> 00:11:13.204
How ironic is that?

00:11:16.609 --> 00:11:18.702
The wormhole driver...

00:11:25.951 --> 00:11:27.714
It's the Great War all over again.

00:12:09.028 --> 00:12:11.588
Magnetic field confirmed.
This is definitely the right direction.

00:12:36.088 --> 00:12:37.556
Where did you learn to quick-draw?

00:12:37.556 --> 00:12:39.925
From Grandpa, when I was with a caravan.

00:12:39.925 --> 00:12:40.826
Grandpa?

00:12:40.826 --> 00:12:43.386
Oh, the man who raised me.

00:12:43.963 --> 00:12:45.364
There was some stuff that happened.

00:12:45.364 --> 00:12:46.365
What stuff?

00:12:46.365 --> 00:12:46.660
What?

00:12:51.837 --> 00:12:55.034
Honoka told Paife the story of her early life.

00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:58.175
Though naturally, she could
not tell her everything.

00:12:58.744 --> 00:13:02.681
So, I've been helped along by
a lot of people in the past,

00:13:02.681 --> 00:13:06.378
and I feel like I should work hard,
partly to be worthy of all that.

00:13:10.556 --> 00:13:14.322
There aren't any people like that in my life.

00:13:14.593 --> 00:13:16.220
I'm sure that's not true.

00:13:19.165 --> 00:13:21.467
There are people who don't trust you.

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:22.024
What?

00:13:22.368 --> 00:13:23.835
Ingrid's one of them.

00:13:24.436 --> 00:13:27.337
I'm the watchdog she's set on you.

00:13:27.573 --> 00:13:28.972
I knew it!

00:13:29.208 --> 00:13:30.470
You're not surprised?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.404
I figured it must be something like that.

00:13:33.579 --> 00:13:35.103
But why you?

00:13:35.581 --> 00:13:37.014
Various reasons.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.777
That woman and I go way back.

00:13:40.386 --> 00:13:42.081
She's a crafty woman.

00:13:42.421 --> 00:13:44.490
You should be careful, too.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.286
Right...

00:13:46.091 --> 00:13:47.388
Aren't you upset?

00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:48.694
About what?

00:13:48.694 --> 00:13:51.063
That you've been stuck with me.

00:13:51.063 --> 00:13:53.258
Doesn't it hurt your pride as a professional?

00:13:53.432 --> 00:13:55.730
I've had stuff like this happen before.

00:13:55.868 --> 00:14:00.305
With clients like that, I just do the
work properly so they'll trust me.

00:14:00.706 --> 00:14:02.799
And if they still don't trust you?

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:06.212
I just have to work at it until they do.

00:14:06.212 --> 00:14:08.908
Come on, don't make me
say such cheesy things.

00:14:25.598 --> 00:14:26.428
Honoka.

00:14:32.404 --> 00:14:33.962
The buggy? Teacher!

00:14:34.306 --> 00:14:35.864
Multiple motion signatures.

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:37.835
They're in the direction the buggy headed off in.

00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:40.646
I can't get a clear read on their
shapes or number, though.

00:14:40.646 --> 00:14:42.014
Stealth coats?

00:14:42.014 --> 00:14:44.483
Their system isn't quite that advanced.

00:14:44.483 --> 00:14:47.350
It's similar to the shielding mode on this tank.

00:14:49.955 --> 00:14:52.355
Fire a flare at the same time
as you launch the PSP.

00:14:52.925 --> 00:14:54.493
Watch out for friendlies.

00:14:54.493 --> 00:14:55.361
You're taking the field?

00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:56.395
Of course I am.

00:14:56.395 --> 00:14:59.231
But there's no need for us
to go looking for trouble.

00:14:59.231 --> 00:15:03.702
When trouble comes calling, you have
to respectfully ask them to leave.

00:15:03.702 --> 00:15:07.502
Besides, as the team leader,
I can't just ignore this.

00:15:08.641 --> 00:15:09.742
Since we've got this opportunity anyway,

00:15:09.742 --> 00:15:12.472
why don't you try out your
new equipment, too, Bogie?

00:15:35.234 --> 00:15:35.928
Teacher!

00:15:44.443 --> 00:15:46.775
You came for me, just like
I thought you would, Hono.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.540
Wow, you look cool, Bogie.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.109
Teacher, we'll cover you.

00:16:19.311 --> 00:16:20.505
Please get back to the tank.

00:16:21.246 --> 00:16:22.213
Teacher!

00:16:27.052 --> 00:16:28.883
Where are you, Hono? Honoka?

00:16:48.741 --> 00:16:49.435
She cut through him?!

00:17:01.487 --> 00:17:02.249
Next!

00:17:09.161 --> 00:17:10.093
We've...

00:17:10.896 --> 00:17:11.920
...met before, haven't we?

00:17:12.598 --> 00:17:14.293
Sword Dancer, eh?

00:17:16.869 --> 00:17:19.167
Take your friends and get out of here.

00:17:19.605 --> 00:17:21.540
You're offering to let us go?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.308
It has nothing to do with letting you go.

00:17:23.308 --> 00:17:26.345
You picked this fight. I'll give as good as I get.

00:17:26.345 --> 00:17:28.480
It's not as if I started this fight with you.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.883
Well, I'm the one finishing it.

00:17:30.883 --> 00:17:31.508
What'll it be?

00:17:43.929 --> 00:17:44.861
Why?

00:17:45.764 --> 00:17:48.665
With a poisonous snake,
you have to crush its head.

00:17:53.806 --> 00:17:56.274
They're the hounds of a religious cult.

00:17:57.109 --> 00:17:58.974
I have a lot of enemies.

00:17:59.445 --> 00:18:05.111
Not too long ago, I was doing the
same thing these guys were doing.

00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:10.322
But I had neither philosophy nor objectives,

00:18:10.322 --> 00:18:12.290
so it was easy for me to quit.

00:18:13.058 --> 00:18:16.084
I'm the only one who thinks that, though.

00:18:16.161 --> 00:18:19.187
You drove out into the desert
to lure these guys out?

00:18:19.364 --> 00:18:20.991
That wasn't the only reason, though.

00:18:38.417 --> 00:18:40.385
Then, the theory that the religious cult...

00:18:40.385 --> 00:18:43.081
...is somehow related to
the sand dragon stampede...

00:18:43.555 --> 00:18:45.216
Is an idiotic rumor.

00:18:45.424 --> 00:18:48.222
There's no way even they could've
pulled off something like that.

00:18:50.429 --> 00:18:51.563
Disappointed?

00:18:51.563 --> 00:18:52.257
What?

00:18:53.565 --> 00:18:55.192
That I'm a murderer.

00:18:57.169 --> 00:19:00.400
I can't believe that you're a bad person.

00:19:00.506 --> 00:19:01.840
Why?!

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.009
You don't know anything about me!

00:19:04.009 --> 00:19:05.477
How can you say that?!

00:19:05.477 --> 00:19:06.444
Because Millie...

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:10.439
...said you were a nice person.

00:19:10.816 --> 00:19:11.748
What?

00:19:42.714 --> 00:19:46.673
On the frontier, monster-like
humans are sometimes born.

00:19:48.153 --> 00:19:51.323
Perhaps a legacy of the Great War,
engraved in human DNA,

00:19:51.323 --> 00:19:56.454
or possibly a mutation brought
about by the harsh environment.

00:19:57.162 --> 00:19:59.460
You saved me again, Hono.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.837
Hono, you...

00:20:17.983 --> 00:20:18.750
Iks...

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:19.580
What?

00:20:26.925 --> 00:20:28.927
The dome's rate of growth is increasing.

00:20:28.927 --> 00:20:30.895
The energy level is also rising.

00:20:31.463 --> 00:20:34.899
At this rate, it will reach the
towns faster than expected.

00:20:35.434 --> 00:20:37.698
Contact the Inspection Force branch in the area.

00:20:37.936 --> 00:20:40.029
Tell them not to allow any
humans near the dome.

00:20:40.472 --> 00:20:42.541
Hurry with the preparation
of the wormhole driver.

00:20:42.541 --> 00:20:42.905
Yes, Ma'am.

00:20:57.623 --> 00:20:58.590
Iks...

00:20:59.825 --> 00:21:02.293
Miss Honoka, has something happened?

00:21:06.932 --> 00:21:09.101
Oh, let me introduce you.

00:21:09.101 --> 00:21:11.737
This is Paife, we're working together right now.

00:21:11.737 --> 00:21:13.739
And this is Iks.

00:21:13.739 --> 00:21:15.866
Um, how should I put this?

00:21:15.941 --> 00:21:18.637
He's my client... I guess.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.045
Nice to meet you.

00:21:20.045 --> 00:21:20.946
Hello.

00:21:20.946 --> 00:21:24.616
You came back so suddenly!
You really surprised me!

00:21:24.616 --> 00:21:25.617
I am sorry.

00:21:25.617 --> 00:21:28.420
Well, you can tell me all about it later. Let's go.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.682
S-Sure...

00:21:33.392 --> 00:21:35.417
Iks, huh?

00:21:40.899 --> 00:21:42.768
Hono...

00:21:42.768 --> 00:21:44.258
Could she be?

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.006
A flexible civilization...
Juunan na bunmei wa

00:21:48.006 --> 00:21:50.509
...is always rapidly advancing.
Itsudatte nisshin-geppo

00:21:50.509 --> 00:21:53.478
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:21:53.478 --> 00:21:57.278
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:22:02.788 --> 00:22:05.757
I realized for the first time...
Hajimete kizuitan da

00:22:05.757 --> 00:22:09.454
...with that line, resembling a surprise attack.
Fui-uchi ni nita sono serifu de

00:22:14.499 --> 00:22:17.436
My sixth sense was pried open.
Kojiakerareta dai-rokkan

00:22:17.436 --> 00:22:21.463
I'd been waiting for this feeling this whole time.
Kono kankaku o zutto matteita

00:22:25.477 --> 00:22:28.447
Opening my heart, just opening it...
Kokoro o hiraite tada hiraite

00:22:28.447 --> 00:22:31.416
I embrace the voices of strangers.
Daisansha no koe ukeireru

00:22:31.416 --> 00:22:34.286
Earnestly persevering, just persevering...
Hitasura koraete tada koraete

00:22:34.286 --> 00:22:37.380
I even try turning pages of criticism.
Hinan no peeji mo aketemiru

00:22:37.689 --> 00:22:40.659
I'm going to leave my...
Toushindai no boku wa

00:22:40.659 --> 00:22:43.595
...true-to-life self behind, right here.
Koko ni oite iku yo

00:22:43.595 --> 00:22:47.432
You can say whatever you want now...
Mou nanto itte kuretemo

00:22:47.432 --> 00:22:48.956
...and I'm fine with that.
Kekkou da

00:22:49.468 --> 00:22:54.940
Ah, how simple is the impulse to evolve.
Aa nante tanjun da shinka shitai to iu shoudou

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:57.843
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:22:57.843 --> 00:23:01.040
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.889
Preview

00:23:17.028 --> 00:23:19.223
The night I saw the other side of Teacher,

00:23:19.598 --> 00:23:21.266
Iks, whom I hadn't seen in a while,

00:23:21.266 --> 00:23:24.136
asked if we'd turn back,
out of worry for me.

00:23:24.136 --> 00:23:27.773
But I felt a premonition of something
and I pressed on through the desert,

00:23:27.773 --> 00:23:30.503
not knowing anything about
what was happening there.

00:23:30.809 --> 00:23:33.645
And not knowing that in the distant heavens,

00:23:33.645 --> 00:23:37.172
the wormhole driver was
counting down towards devastation.

00:23:37.716 --> 00:23:40.852
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.852 --> 00:23:42.053
episode 10, "Gravestone".

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.188
Gravestone
episode 10, "Gravestone".

00:23:43.188 --> 00:23:44.917
Gravestone
